DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The nnffee driver supports Fast Ethernet and Gigabit Ethernet adapters based
     on the NVIDIA nForce Media and Communications Processors (MCP), the
     nForce, nForce 2, nForce 3, CK804, MCP04, MCP51, MCP55, MCP61, MCP65,
     MCP67, MCP73, MCP77, MCP79 and MCP89 Ethernet controller chips.

     The nnffee driver supports IPv4 transmit/receive IP/TCP/UDP checksum offload
     with the nForce 3, CK804, MCP55, MCP77, MCP79 and MCP89 chipsets and VLAN
     tag insertion and stripping with the MCP55 chipset.

     The nnffee driver additionally supports Wake on LAN (WoL).  See arp(8) and
     ifconfig(8) for more details.

     The nnffee driver supports the following _m_e_d_i_a types:

     aauuttoosseelleecctt  Enable autoselection of the media type and options.
     1100bbaasseeTT     Set 10Mbps operation.
     110000bbaasseeTTXX   Set 100Mbps (Fast Ethernet) operation.
     11000000bbaasseeTT   Set 1000Mbps (Gigabit Ethernet) operation (recent models
                 only).

